On Tue, Aug 02, 2005 at 05:01:34PM +0100, Angus MacGyver wrote:
+> So, question is, how do i get / mounted as / in a jail (if that is possible)

This is done in 6.x and above. You need to set sysctl
security.jail.enforce_statfs to 1.

